 ===============================================================================
  IGS Satellite Meta Data                                                       
 ===============================================================================
                                                                                
   Satellite meta data for GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou, QZSS, and IRNSS.      
                                                                                
   Steigenberger P, Montenbruck O (2024) IGS Satellite Metadata File Description
        Version 1.10, September 30, 2024, doi: 10.57677/metadata-sinex          
        https://files.igs.org/pub/resource/working_groups/multi_gnss/           
                Metadata_SINEX_1.10.pdf                                         
                                                                                
   The following SINEX blocks are included:                                     
                                                                                
   - SATELLITE/IDENTIFIER        SVN, COSPAR ID, satellite catalogue number     
                                 (NORAD ID), satellite block                    
   - SATELLITE/PLANE             Orbital plane and slot                         
   - SATELLITE/PRN               SVN/PRN assignment                             
   - SATELLITE/FREQUENCY_CHANNEL GLONASS frequency channel numbers              
   - SATELLITE/MASS              In-orbit satellite mass                        
   - SATELLITE/COM               Center-of-mass information                     
   - SATELLITE/ECCENTRICITY      Equipment eccentricities, e.g., reference point
                                 for GNSS transmit antennas, satellite laser    
                                 ranging retroreflector array                   
   - SATELLITE/TX_POWER          L-Band transmit power                          
                                                                                
